<message conversation_id="7">
  <ts>2020-04-01T02:33:57.917000</ts>
  <user>Richmond</user>
  <text>positional arg:```py&gt;&gt;&gt; def foo(kwargs):... print(kwargs)...&gt;&gt;&gt; foo(\'"x":"bar"\')Traceback (most recent call last): File &lt;stdin&gt; line 1 in &lt;module&gt;TypeError: foo() takes 0 positional arguments but 1 was given&gt;&gt;&gt; foo(\'x="bar"\')Traceback (most recent call last): File &lt;stdin&gt; line 1 in &lt;module&gt;TypeError: foo() takes 0 positional arguments but 1 was given&gt;&gt;&gt;```</text>
</message>
<message conversation_id="7">
  <ts>2020-04-01T02:34:10.792000</ts>
