  <user>Khouri</user>
  <text>Hi! In a script I\'m writing I\'ve got a bunch of nested if elif else statements making up some sort of a decision tree. I can get my head around it fine but I was wondering if there was any better way to write it. Some sort of a cleaner alternative to nested ifs</text>
</message>
<message conversation_id="75">
  <ts>2020-04-02T10:50:23.095000</ts>
  <user>Lukas</user>
