</message>
<message conversation_id="75">
  <ts>2020-04-02T10:50:42.412000</ts>
  <user>Lukas</user>
  <text>no problems because I used tokens for this</text>
</message>
<message conversation_id="75">
  <ts>2020-04-02T10:50:56.237000</ts>
  <user>Heidy</user>
  <text>an if ... if can sometimes be written better with logical and</text>
</message>
<message conversation_id="75">
  <ts>2020-04-02T10:51:02.116000</ts>
  <user>Lukas</user>
  <text>the only problem is that you can't do that style: ```pydef f(x){ return x;}```</text>
</message>
