</message>
<message conversation_id="75">
  <ts>2020-04-02T10:51:27.808000</ts>
  <user>Allanah</user>
  <text>nested ifs can often be rewritten like so```py{ (True False): action, (False True): action2,}[cond1 cond2](args)```</text>
</message>
<message conversation_id="75">
