</message>
<message conversation_id="88">
  <ts>2020-04-02T18:49:27.095000</ts>
  <user>Elies</user>
  <text>Oh. Why does asyncio perform better?</text>
</message>
<message conversation_id="88">
  <ts>2020-04-02T18:49:53.221000</ts>
  <user>Lucius</user>
  <text>do you know how asynchronous code works? if not you'll have to read up a guide</text>
</message>
<message conversation_id="88">
  <ts>2020-04-02T18:50:06.546000</ts>
  <user>Blayne</user>
  <text>A thread has a lot of overhead</text>
</message>
<message conversation_id="88">
  <ts>2020-04-02T18:50:10.525000</ts>
  <user>Carmela</user>
