</message>
<message conversation_id="88">
  <ts>2020-04-02T18:50:10.983000</ts>
  <user>Blayne</user>
  <text>Asyncio does not suffer from this</text>
</message>
<message conversation_id="88">
  <ts>2020-04-02T18:50:23.019000</ts>
  <user>Blayne</user>
  <text>Asynchronous programming makes much more sense for IO types of tasks</text>
