  <text>@Akash jut a quick warning here though HTML and CSS are easy to learn but CSS is really hard to do well if you don't spend the time to really get familiar with it. So don't be discouraged if things don't work the way you want centering text for example requires you to understand a good bit about how CSS can control content.And finally I will leave you with this warning JS is not the most efficient language in the world so be careful because it's easy to have unintended bugs and bloat in your program. A slightly more advanced tidbit but it's something you should understand from the start.</text>
