  <user>Bryceon</user>
  <text>I want to write something using this logic how would I basically initialize a key/value if it doesn't exist else add 1 to it?```pythondict = {}list = ['apple apple blueberry onion']for i in list: dict[i] += 1 if dict[i] in dict else 1```</text>
</message>
<message conversation_id="121">
  <ts>2020-04-03T09:13:59.776000</ts>
  <user>Anabelle</user>
  <text>use defaultdict</text>
</message>
<message conversation_id="121">
  <ts>2020-04-03T09:14:21.628000</ts>
  <user>Anabelle</user>
  <text>or Counter</text>
</message>
<message conversation_id="121">
  <ts>2020-04-03T09:15:05.556000</ts>
  <user>Allanah</user>
  <text>you can also use `.setdefault`</text>
</message>
<message conversation_id="121">
  <ts>2020-04-03T09:15:19.513000</ts>
  <user>Bryceon</user>
  <text>ohh hmm okay</text>
</message>
<message conversation_id="119">
  <ts>2020-04-03T09:15:23.392000</ts>
