  <ts>2020-04-03T23:34:30.715000</ts>
  <user>Loukas</user>
  <text>@Λcє That notation is frequently used in math for denoting ranges. The `[` means including and after the `)` means before but not including. I.E. `(10 15]` would be numbers after 10 (not including 10) and up to 15 (including 15). Can also be written as `10 &lt; n &lt;= 15`.</text>
</message>
<message conversation_id="150">
