<message conversation_id="152">
  <ts>2020-04-04T01:09:59.197000</ts>
  <user>Lukas</user>
  <text>```py&gt;&gt;&gt; dis.dis('user.sub != 0') 1 0 LOAD_NAME 0 (user) 2 LOAD_ATTR 1 (sub) 4 LOAD_CONST 0 (0) 6 COMPARE_OP 3 (!=) 8 RETURN_VALUE&gt;&gt;&gt; dis.dis('False if user.sub == 0 else True') 1 0 LOAD_NAME 0 (user) 2 LOAD_ATTR 1 (sub) 4 LOAD_CONST 0 (0) 6 COMPARE_OP 2 (==) 8 POP_JUMP_IF_FALSE 14 10 LOAD_CONST 1 (False) 12 RETURN_VALUE &gt;&gt; 14 LOAD_CONST 2 (True) 16 RETURN_VALUE``` your approach is a bit busier as you can see haha</text>
</message>
