  <text>```pyparens = ((())())'contexts = []for index paren in enumerate(parens): if paren == (': contexts.append([index None]) elif paren == )': for context in reversed(contexts): if context[1] is None: context[1] = index break else: raise SyntaxError('Unmatched parens!')print(contexts)``` @Leterax I would look for indexes of matching parentheses like this</text>
