<message conversation_id="167">
  <ts>2020-04-04T10:55:44.734000</ts>
  <user>Mihaela</user>
  <text>```py&gt;&gt;&gt; import builtins&gt;&gt;&gt; builtins.object = list&gt;&gt;&gt; class A: pass&gt;&gt;&gt; A.__mro__(&lt;class __main__.A'&gt; &lt;class object'&gt;)&gt;&gt;&gt; class A(object): pass&gt;&gt;&gt; A.__mro__(&lt;class __main__.A'&gt; &lt;class list'&gt; &lt;class object'&gt;)&gt;&gt;&gt; ```@lakmatiol @Kisho</text>
</message>
<message conversation_id="167">
